      "title": "§ 32c(7) EStG reads “im Sinne des Absatz 5” instead of “des Absatzes 5”",
      "summary": "The genitive ending is missing. The wording goes back to Federal Law Gazette 2024 I No. 321.",
      "impact": "Editorial. The meaning is clear.",
      "correction": "Write “des Absatzes 5”."
    },
